# sdist 的种子是 git 跟踪的全部文件（所以 docs/ 会随包分发），再叠加 [tool.setuptools.packages.find] 指定的包；
# wheel 则只含 rqamsh/ 与 dist-info，与 sdist 不同。
# 下面显式排除不该分发的内容：测试、本地材料与内部开发文档（后两者不在 git 中，属于防御性声明）。
# 核心案例与定位说明随 sdist 分发，不作为 wheel 运行包或入口。
include CHANGELOG.md
recursive-include docs *.md
prune docs/demo
include docs/demo/README.md
recursive-include docs/demo/workspace-routing *.md *.py *.json *.csv *.xlsx
recursive-include docs/demo/historical-trade-correction *.md *.py *.json *.csv *.xlsx
recursive-include docs/demo/valuation-report-reconciliation *.md *.py *.json *.csv *.xlsx
recursive-include docs/demo/reconciliation-controls *.md *.py *.json *.csv *.xlsx
recursive-include docs/demo/returns-diagnosis *.md
prune tests
prune local
prune artifacts
exclude AGENT.md
